Hello Everyone -

Again I want to thank each and everyone of you who have helped, and those that
are currently helping me with my AX25 node installation problems.  Your time
and consideration are GREATLY APPRECIATED!

Some of you are working with me on my AX25 node installation problems, I am
sure that we will get those problems fixed with your help.  After the node issues
are resolved I have one more HUGE problem that I humbly request your help
with.  I am getting the sudden death XFBB error from hell "Unknown return value
127"!.  I have edited all the files that I consider to be important...especially:

init.srv
port.sys
forward.sys & assosicated forward files
reject.sys
swapp.sys

No matter what I do XFBB just will not run...period.  Just to rule out some kind
of problem on my prototype system I tried to install XFBB on my other two RH
7.2 servers (WEB, TNOS).  It won't work on those servers either...same error.
So, I have got to be overlooking something.  Some of you have suggested using
special flags with the "xfbb.sh" shell to get more exact output but I get absolutely
nothing.  I can imagine that allot of you have seen this error.  I need some very
specific information as to how you got around it.  To help you rule out some
concerns that you might have I am attaching some important files to this
email.  The files are:

1)    init.srv
2)    eobbs (this is a forward file that is called up from forward.sys)
3)    fbb.system.tar.gz (this is everything in my /usr/local/fbb/system directory)
4)    output.txt (output of "ifconfig")
5)    rc.local

Any information that you could offer to resolve this problem would be appreciated!

Regards,

